13375 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 13376 0 R/Alt(Two block diagrams. (a) Next-state logic with the inputs clr_i and en_i feeds a register cnt_q of three flip-flops, whose output is fed back to the logic and drives a decoder from 3 to 8 bits with the output q_o of 8 bits. (b) Eight flip-flops in a row, each output feeding the D input of the next one, with the output of the last one fed back to the first. Each flip-flop output is also one bit of q_o, from q_o[0] to q_o[7].)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 29172 0 R>>
endobj
